リテラルゴリラにマッチするのはその帰結というかんじ","ts":"1625716690.372000","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1625716735.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vg54O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d8e5f40-8189-4b39-8b6d-556ae0038729","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1625715596.371100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oCl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"782928e5-ee82-4aef-bd65-faed9a9dbd96","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こういうことか","ts":"1625715588.370900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XI9/F"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        */zero-width*\n        \"\\@=\" (や、\"^\"、\"$\"、\"\\\u0026lt;\"、\"\\\u0026gt;\"、など) を使った場合、その文字はマッチ\n        に含まれません。これらのアイテムは、マッチすることができるかどうかの\n        チェックだけに使われます。続くアイテムが同じ場所でマッチすることに注意\n        してください。上記の最後の例は \"foobarfoo\" にはマッチしません。\"bar\"\n        がマッチしたのと同じ場所で \"foo\" とマッチしようとするからです。\n \n        Note: \"\\\u0026amp;\" は \"\\@=\" と同じような働きをします。\"foo\\\u0026amp;..\" と\n        \"\\(foo\\)\\@=..\" は同じです。カッコを書かなくていいので \"\\\u0026amp;\" の方が簡単\n        です。\n```","ts":"1625715583.370700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fcbe7879-0575-4006-9673-43fd733e41b1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":h /zero-width","ts":"1625715583.370600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2xAL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4f17730-74f8-4d7c-bb1b-e7eb0f6c3455","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ゼロ幅マッチだから直後のパターンはあまり関係ないか…\n`\\%V({hello})` とかできるのかと思ったけど無理そう","ts":"1625715578.370500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C0+I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43bb0712-5712-4778-8a39-0cc47ad15f7a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ここの部分か\n```パターンを選択範囲内でマッチさ\n        せたい場合は、パターンの最初と最後の直前にこれを指定してください。例:  \n                /\\%Vfoo.*ba\\%Vr```","ts":"1625715494.369800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Go"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84e5a50d-045e-4292-998c-5fa0ee1480f1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`\\%V` は「直後のパターンがビジュアルモードに入っていればマッチ」というルール、という理解で良さそう？","ts":"1625715462.369300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4T9X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa401f49-6cfc-409b-aa56-554f50289c50","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":rikai:","ts":"1625715391.368500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be3e64ed-acc0-4d37-8389-33b1bd890dc9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そういうことか","ts":"1625715387.368300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jt9xD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b7d9e8e-62fd-436b-b045-10b69ac4c569","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー","ts":"1625715385.368100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Ej"}]},{"client_msg_id":"235bc18b-3c1d-4942-9890-43b592b470db","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もし {world} という文字列全体がビジュアルモードに入っているときだけマッチするようにしたいのであれば、\n`\\%V{world\\%V}`\nってやる必要があるみたいですね。ヘルプ読んだところ。","ts":"1625715361.367700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625715379.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngX4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baf057b4-4d94-4e8b-ba08-53354277694d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ビジュアルモードで選択した範囲内、という理解であっていますか？","ts":"1625715264.366800","team":"T03C4RC8V","repl